---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={'Capabilities'} description={'Cloud data platforms, secure applications, high-performance distributed systems and AI-enabled automation, each linked to the work that proves it.'} page="capabilities">
<section class="page" id="p-capabilities" data-title="Capabilities">
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><span class="label">Capabilities</span><h1>Ten competencies.<br>Four disciplines.</h1><p class="lede">Each one links to the work that proves it.</p></div></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap twocol">
      <div class="stackL">
        <div class="block"><span class="label ember">01 · Data platforms and analytics</span><h2>Data platforms and analytics</h2><p>We move organizations off aging warehouses onto governed cloud platforms, then cut the reporting sprawl that built up around the old system.</p>
          <div class="tablebox"><table><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Cloud data platforms</th><td>Snowflake, dbt, Data Vault 2.0 on AWS and Azure; Oracle, SQL Server, Teradata and SAS migrations</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Integration</th><td>Qlik, Airbyte, Azure Data Factory, Prefect, Airflow, Kafka, REST and GraphQL</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Governance</th><td>RBAC, data masking, audit controls, data quality, OpenMetadata</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Analytics and BI</th><td>Power BI, Tableau, SSRS, SSAS, MicroStrategy; report consolidation</td></tr>
          </tbody></table></div>
          <p class="note">Proven on <a href="/past-performance/">logistics contractor</a>, <a href="/past-performance/">Fortune 500 homebuilder</a>, <a href="/past-performance/">compliance software provider</a>, <a href="/past-performance/">domain registration group</a></p></div>
        <div class="block"><span class="label ember">02 · Applications and systems</span><h2>Applications and systems</h2><p>Secure web and mobile applications, and distributed systems where every microsecond and every signature matters.</p>
          <div class="tablebox"><table><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Full-stack and mobile</th><td>React, Vue.js, Java/Spring Boot, Go, Python, PostgreSQL, Oracle; offline-first Android</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Distributed systems</th><td>Lock-free C++ and Go, message queues, sub-millisecond processing</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Applied cryptography</th><td>ECDSA/Ed25519 signing, key handling, tamper-evident records</td></tr>
          </tbody></table></div>
          <p class="note">Proven on <a href="/projects/">MedTransport</a>, <a href="/projects/">trading system</a>, <a href="/past-performance/">clinical genomics lab</a>, <a href="/past-performance/">beauty e-commerce</a></p></div>
        <div class="block"><span class="label ember">03 · AI-enabled automation</span><h2>AI-enabled automation</h2><p>LLM integration and agent infrastructure that speeds up delivery and operations, with a person reviewing every consequential output.</p>
          <div class="tablebox"><table><tbody><tr><th scope="row">AI automation</th><td>LLM integration, MCP agent infrastructure, AI-assisted development with human review</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <p class="note">Proven on <a href="/past-performance/">compliance software provider</a>, where staffing went from 20 to 5</p></div>
        <div class="block"><span class="label ember">04 · Reliability and delivery</span><h2>Reliability and delivery</h2><p>Systems that stay up, and programs that land on schedule.</p>
          <div class="tablebox"><table><tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Observability</th><td>OpenTelemetry, Datadog, SigNoz, CloudWatch, incident response, database tuning</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Program management</th><td>Requirements, integration, testing, CI/CD, Terraform</td></tr>
          </tbody></table></div></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side" aria-label="Regulated data">
        <span class="label">Across every discipline</span>
        <h3>Regulated data</h3>
        <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:.92rem"><li>HIPAA-grade access controls</li><li>PII handling and masking</li><li>Row-level security and MFA</li><li>Audit logging</li><li>Tamper-evident signed records</li></ul>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/contracting/" style="align-self:flex-start">Contracting information <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
</Base>
